{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hkoFjbf9TE1794470077.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>立法會三讀通過北都專屬法例《北部都會區發展條例草案》。</p><p></p><p>條例草案指明北都發展六個政策範疇，並授權行政長官會同行政會議訂立附屬法例，包括簡化城規程序、將非保育地帶改劃用途的審批時間由9個月縮短至2個月，以及打通人流、物流，資金流和數據流的便利措施，擴展至河套以外的北都其他地區。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.L.NORTH-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ryz83JHXTc1794470084.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>發展局局長甯漢豪指，明年一月向立法會提交相關附屬法例，爭取相關便利措施，明年首季生效。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.792155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T22:37:33.391384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:22.178827+00:00","content_hash":"4ee2cea15b5e1f91712f7b4195172f999885628bf3759f004ea07eae0f6f65ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.792155+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}